14
03:08.900 --> 03:09.560
Okay.

15
03:27.620 --> 03:28.430
Sorry.

16
03:28.710 --> 03:29.590
It took us a while to reach

17
03:29.590 --> 03:30.470
the maintenance company,

18
03:30.470 --> 03:31.240
so you had to stay inside

19
03:31.240 --> 03:32.020
a bit longer.

20
03:32.020 --> 03:33.060
I'm really sorry.

21
03:34.370 --> 03:35.170
All right.

22
03:35.700 --> 03:36.460
Let's just let it go this time

23
03:36.460 --> 03:37.750
since we were lucky.

24
03:37.970 --> 03:38.630
Don't worry.

25
03:38.630 --> 03:39.800
I'll learn from this.

26
03:39.800 --> 03:40.410
Something like this

27
03:40.410 --> 03:41.310
won't happen again.

28
03:41.310 --> 03:42.520
I'm sorry. Let's go.

29
03:56.790 --> 03:57.660
Thanks...

30
03:58.690 --> 04:00.820
for coming all the way out here so late.

31
04:03.350 --> 04:04.810
I came because I wanted to.

32
04:06.870 --> 04:07.680
Anyway,

33
04:08.290 --> 04:10.220
