34
04:13.410 --> 04:15.860
I need to go to the third floor to get some documents.

35
04:15.860 --> 04:17.570
Can you come with me?

36
04:18.740 --> 04:19.300
Yeah.

37
05:09.930 --> 05:11.600
It's too dark here.

38
05:11.630 --> 05:12.890
