44
06:03.660 --> 06:04.180
Yes.

45
06:04.830 --> 06:06.570
I'll walk you to your car, then.

46
06:49.220 --> 06:50.190
Fu Shize.

47
06:55.700 --> 06:56.760
This is for you.

48
07:15.940 --> 07:17.760
♪ It's as if I hear a voice ♪

49
