59
07:54.680 --> 07:55.270
No need

60
07:56.650 --> 07:59.340
♪ That we'll meet someday ♪

61
08:01.730 --> 08:03.310
♪ It's you ♪

62
08:03.340 --> 08:05.640
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

63
08:05.660 --> 08:07.190
♪ Just you ♪

64
08:07.210 --> 08:09.580
