79
08:30.530 --> 08:32.940
♪ It's you ♪

80
08:30.930 --> 08:32.100
If you refuse again,

81
08:32.100 --> 08:32.909
I'll take off my coat

82
08:32.909 --> 08:33.620
and put it

83
08:35.890 --> 08:36.840
on you, too.

84
08:44.020 --> 08:45.610
♪ It's you ♪

85
08:45.630 --> 08:47.940
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

86
08:46.480 --> 08:47.080
Let's go.

87
08:47.960 --> 08:49.480
