♪ By your side ♪

97
09:08.420 --> 09:09.410
♪ Even the most ordinary seasons ♪

98
09:09.430 --> 09:11.780
♪ Feel warm again ♪

99
09:12.830 --> 09:15.230
♪ It's you ♪

100
09:17.580 --> 09:19.720
Why did you come looking for me?

101
09:20.440 --> 09:21.940
You sent me an SOS message.

102
09:23.170 --> 09:24.700
That wasn't an SOS message.

103
09:25.580 --> 09:26.870
I was trapped.

104
09:26.900 --> 09:28.900
I wanted to seek comfort from you.

105
09:30.480 --> 09:31.200
I didn't mean to make you

106
09:31.200 --> 09:32.600
come all the way out here.

107
09:32.740 --> 09:35.130
Besides, security showed up eventually.

108
09:38.170 --> 09:38.770
I...

109
09:45.050 --> 09:46.000
I went to the main building

110
09:46.000 --> 09:46.670
to get them.

111
09:51.440 --> 09:52.480
To thank you,

112
09:52.480 --> 09:54.610
let me treat you to a late-night snack.

113
09:58.740 --> 09:59.290
No.

114
09:59.290 --> 10:00.210
It's cold outside.

115
10:00.210 --> 10:01.890
Then let's find a place with AC.

116
10:01.890 --> 10:02.790
It's too stuffy.

117
10:02.790 --> 10:04.600
Then... let's get takeout.

118
10:04.820 --> 10:05.750
Cleaning up is a hassle.

119
10:05.750 --> 10:07.160
I can clean it up for you.

120
10:15.480 --> 10:16.610
I'll drive you back.

121
10:28.000 --> 10:29.340
You're driving me back?

122
10:30.340 --> 10:31.140
What's wrong?

123
10:32.880 --> 10:33.760
Nothing.

124
10:34.240 --> 10:35.030
That's nice.

125
11:16.530 --> 11:18.250
She didn't even message me.

126
11:20.860 --> 11:22.390
Is she not coming?

127
11:23.050 --> 11:24.510
Why are you looking for me?

128
11:28.960 --> 11:30.670
You came after all.

129
11:33.350 --> 11:35.060
You're running around in a cast?

130
11:35.060 --> 11:36.030
Do you want to wreck

131
11:36.030 --> 11:37.030
your leg for good?

132
11:39.530 --> 11:40.390
The doctor said

133
11:40.620 --> 11:41.500
it's almost healed

134
11:41.500 --> 11:43.230
and told me to move around more.

135
11:43.740 --> 11:44.870
If anything goes wrong,

136
11:44.870 --> 11:45.840
don't blame me.

137
11:46.910 --> 11:49.410
Then... I can at least go for a walk, right?

138
11:55.850 --> 11:56.770
It smells so good.

139
11:56.770 --> 11:57.580
Look over there.

140
11:57.580 --> 11:58.790
They're selling snacks.

141
11:58.790 --> 11:59.720
Do you want some?

142
12:03.390 --> 12:04.000
Well,

143
12:04.000 --> 12:05.580
