144
12:05.580 --> 12:07.580
That'd defeat the purpose of your run.

145
12:07.580 --> 12:08.480
You asked me out.

146
12:08.480 --> 12:09.980
What do you want to say?

147
12:10.040 --> 12:11.280
Just say it.

148
12:11.500 --> 12:12.700
Just say it?

149
12:13.690 --> 12:14.750
How should I say it?

150
12:15.600 --> 12:16.340
I just feel like

151
12:16.340 --> 12:17.530
you've been acting a little weird

152
12:17.530 --> 12:19.030
around me lately.

153
12:19.170 --> 12:19.890
And I feel like

154
12:19.890 --> 12:21.420
you're always avoiding me.

155
12:23.420 --> 12:24.830
It's not like you need me anyway.

156
12:24.830 --> 12:26.630
What do you mean I don't need you?

157
12:30.080 --> 12:30.890
I...

158
12:31.940 --> 12:33.790
My leg is injured, isn't it?

159
12:35.030 --> 12:35.790
You've got

160
12:35.790 --> 12:37.740
so many girls looking after you.

161
12:38.040 --> 12:39.940
Why would I get in the way?

162
12:40.440 --> 12:41.930
What do you mean, get in the way?

163
12:41.930 --> 12:42.790
I've never

164
12:42.790 --> 12:44.340
felt this lonely in my life.

165
12:48.770 --> 12:49.870
Can we still be

166
12:49.870 --> 12:51.340
like we used to be?

167
12:51.770 --> 12:52.650
No.

168
12:57.510 --> 13:00.000
Can we still be friends?

169
13:00.080 --> 13:00.870
We'll see.

170
13:01.480 --> 13:02.340
I'm going for my run.

171
13:02.340 --> 13:03.670
Take your time walking.

172
13:05.110 --> 13:05.910
Tang Lin,

173
13:06.200 --> 13:07.200
