174
13:12.630 --> 13:14.760
I thought your foot hadn't healed yet.

175
13:15.580 --> 13:17.130
You big liar!

176
13:17.630 --> 13:18.870
Help!

177
13:26.500 --> 13:27.080
Well,

178
13:27.530 --> 13:29.050
text me when you get back.

179
13:31.010 --> 13:31.550
Bye-bye.

180
13:46.760 --> 13:49.570
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

181
13:50.320 --> 13:52.970
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

182
13:53.770 --> 13:56.180
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

183
13:56.200 --> 13:59.400
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

184
14:00.310 --> 14:03.400
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

185
14:03.900 --> 14:06.060
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

186
14:06.320 --> 14:09.360
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

187
14:10.060 --> 14:13.360
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

188
14:14.930 --> 14:17.860
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

189
14:17.880 --> 14:20.040
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

190
14:21.920 --> 14:24.870
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

191
14:24.890 --> 14:27.180
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

192
14:25.200 --> 14:26.120
You're home?

193
14:28.260 --> 14:31.830
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

194
14:32.000 --> 14:34.860
♪ To meet the moon ♪

195
14:34.890 --> 14:37.820
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

196
14:36.170 --> 14:36.860
Not yet.

197
14:37.840 --> 14:40.730
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

198
14:40.760 --> 14:44.920
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

199
14:41.220 --> 14:42.600
Text me when you

200
14:42.820 --> 14:44.000
get home safe.

201
14:45.250 --> 14:48.120
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

202
14:48.220 --> 14:51.960
♪ Love gives us all ♪

203
14:51.980 --> 14:55.040
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

204
14:55.060 --> 14:55.880
♪ You know ♪

205
14:55.900 --> 14:59.140
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

206
14:59.160 --> 15:01.970
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

207
15:02.000 --> 15:05.580
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

208
15:06.470 --> 15:11.370
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

209
15:21.490 --> 15:23.240
