210
15:23.190 --> 15:26.460
♪ Practice the poem of love time and again ♪

211
15:26.480 --> 15:29.880
♪ Where should I begin with these soft and low whispers? ♪

212
15:29.910 --> 15:33.040
♪ The moonlight is gently cast upon your name ♪

213
15:33.070 --> 15:37.260
♪ I look up, and you're always there, so tenderly ♪

214
15:34.200 --> 15:35.890
You're crazy.

215
15:37.510 --> 15:39.970
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

216
15:39.990 --> 15:42.620
♪ Through ceaseless tides that ebb and flow ♪

217
15:44.350 --> 15:46.850
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

218
15:46.870 --> 15:50.260
♪ As we feel the changes of seasons ♪

219
15:50.840 --> 15:54.410
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

220
15:54.580 --> 15:57.440
♪ To meet the moon ♪

221
15:57.470 --> 16:00.150
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

222
16:00.170 --> 16:03.310
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

223
16:03.450 --> 16:04.270
♪ You know ♪

224
16:04.290 --> 16:07.530
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

225
16:07.550 --> 16:10.360
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

226
16:10.390 --> 16:13.970
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

227
16:14.860 --> 16:19.760
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

228
16:38.890 --> 16:40.170
Morning, Lili.

229
16:41.030 --> 16:42.240
Morning, Tangy.

230
16:46.670 --> 16:48.630
Why are your dark circles so bad?

231
16:49.120 --> 16:50.720
Yours are pretty bad, too.

232
16:50.720 --> 16:51.770
Didn't you sleep?

233
16:52.890 --> 16:53.980
Don't mention it.

234
16:54.390 --> 16:57.130
A mosquitokept me up all night.

235
16:57.670 --> 16:58.480
A mosquito?

236
17:00.170 --> 17:01.270
I couldn't kill it

237
17:01.300 --> 17:02.460
or shoo it away.

238
17:02.870 --> 17:04.180
It kept me awake all night.

239
17:04.180 --> 17:05.140
So annoying.

240
17:05.140 --> 17:05.829
No way.

241
17:05.829 --> 17:08.359
How are there mosquitoes out in this weather?

242
17:10.810 --> 17:13.500
So what did this mosquito look like?

243
17:13.770 --> 17:15.740
Did it have a bad leg,

244
17:15.740 --> 17:17.030
wear a cast, and...

245
17:19.190 --> 17:20.640
Don't mention him to me.

246
17:21.380 --> 17:22.240
What about you?

247
17:22.589 --> 17:23.530
Were you also

248
17:23.530 --> 17:24.740
kept awake

249
17:24.740 --> 17:25.829
by a big mosquito?

250
17:26.630 --> 17:28.380
I wasn't having trouble sleeping.

251
17:28.380 --> 17:29.770
I stayed up all night

252
17:29.770 --> 17:31.090
making a drone.

253
17:31.440 --> 17:32.900
Why are you making a drone?

254
17:35.690 --> 17:37.670
I should've asked that.

255
17:38.900 --> 17:39.790
Let's drop it.

256
17:39.790 --> 17:40.980
I have to go restock.

257
17:41.590 --> 17:42.400
I've got some ready-made ones here.

258
17:42.400 --> 17:43.440
I'll pack one for you.

259
17:43.440 --> 17:44.170
I'm on a diet.

260
17:45.480 --> 17:46.830
Why are you on a diet?

261
18:13.500 --> 18:14.180
Li.

262
18:14.180 --> 18:15.640
Did you deliver the gift?

263
18:15.940 --> 18:17.770
Why are you so worked up about it so early

264
18:17.770 --> 18:19.240
instead of going to class?

265
18:20.250 --> 18:20.940
Li.

266
18:20.940 --> 18:22.050
I've sent you

267
18:22.050 --> 18:23.650
the thank-you red envelope.

268
18:23.790 --> 18:25.500
Isn't that what you owe me?

269
18:25.740 --> 18:26.920
Li, please.

270
18:27.030 --> 18:28.960
Can you deliver it for me tomorrow?

271
18:31.330 --> 18:32.830
Let me make this clear.

272
18:33.030 --> 18:34.360
I'm against puppy love.

273
18:35.200 --> 18:36.350
I know, I know.

274
18:37.380 --> 18:38.780
What's that on your desk?

275
18:38.900 --> 18:39.720
A drone?

276
18:42.250 --> 18:43.140
Nothing.

277
18:43.530 --> 18:44.400
It's a gift.

278
18:45.880 --> 18:48.220
Is it for Shize?

279
18:48.740 --> 18:49.880
Nonsense.

280
18:50.400 --> 18:52.000
Don't worry, Li.

281
18:52.000 --> 18:53.070
I'll wait until college

282
18:53.070 --> 18:54.500
to start dating, just like you.

283
18:54.500 --> 18:55.010
Then

284
18:55.010 --> 18:56.900
I'll give her a drone, too.

285
18:57.330 --> 18:58.940
If you keep running your mouth,

286
18:58.940 --> 18:59.940
I might just send your gift

287
18:59.940 --> 19:01.140
back to you.

288
19:01.160 --> 19:02.340
No, no, no.

289
19:02.420 --> 19:03.740
Li, I'm kidding.

290
19:03.740 --> 19:05.180
I'll make you a promise.

291
19:05.530 --> 19:07.140
I promise it won't affect my studies.

292
19:07.140 --> 19:08.940
Besides, Yunyi has good grades.

293
19:09.030 --> 19:11.560
She should have no problem getting into XUST.

294
19:11.700 --> 19:12.940
She can get in.

295
19:13.070 --> 19:15.090
You should worry about yourself.

296
19:18.240 --> 19:20.770
I just took a test last week.

297
19:21.640 --> 19:23.290
I made the top ten in my grade again.

298
19:23.290 --> 19:24.810
Okay, I'm hanging up.

299
19:25.060 --> 19:25.860
Li.

300
19:26.180 --> 19:27.050
You must help me

301
19:27.050 --> 19:28.050
deliver the gift.

302
19:37.000 --> 19:37.660
Hello.

303
19:37.790 --> 19:39.250
I'm Yun Ye's older sister.

304
19:39.270 --> 19:41.090
Yun Ye asked me to drop something off for you.

305
19:41.090 --> 19:43.460
When would be a good time for you?

306
19:48.860 --> 19:50.210
I have time tomorrow.

307
19:50.240 --> 19:51.330
Are you free?

308
19:58.920 --> 19:59.480
Okay.

309
19:59.680 --> 20:00.940
Let's meet at the café

310
20:00.940 --> 20:02.470
in Tianqi Square tomorrow.

311
20:03.480 --> 20:04.900
Okay, Li.

312
20:05.190 --> 20:06.190
See you tomorrow.

313
20:10.310 --> 20:10.900
Brother,

314
20:11.660 --> 20:12.900
a classmate is having someone

315
20:12.900 --> 20:14.850
drop something off for me tomorrow.

316
20:14.850 --> 20:16.110
Can you give me a ride?

317
20:16.290 --> 20:17.420
What classmate?

318
20:17.700 --> 20:19.000
Didn't I tell you?

319
20:19.400 --> 20:21.220
You are at a critical stage right now,

320
20:21.220 --> 20:22.000
so you need to focus all your attention

321
20:22.000 --> 20:23.000
on your studies.

322
20:23.350 --> 20:25.160
Don't get too close to your classmates.

323
20:25.160 --> 20:25.960
I know.

324
20:26.400 --> 20:27.700
But that classmate's sister

325
20:27.700 --> 20:29.310
finally found some time.

326
20:30.160 --> 20:31.350
Your classmate's sister?

327
20:31.350 --> 20:32.810
You've met her too.

328
20:32.810 --> 20:35.210
The one in the convenience store last time.

329
20:38.090 --> 20:40.090
Then we shouldn't keep her waiting.

330
20:40.250 --> 20:41.980
I'll drive you there tomorrow.

331
20:46.550 --> 20:47.820
The room has been booked.

332
20:47.820 --> 20:48.730
I'll send the details

333
20:48.730 --> 20:49.930
to your phone in a bit.

334
20:50.750 --> 20:52.080
Okay, see you tomorrow.

335
20:53.740 --> 20:55.400
Wonders will never cease.

336
20:55.700 --> 20:56.750
Is this really Zhengchu,

337
