682
37:19.940 --> 37:23.380
I want to ruin her reputation

683
37:23.690 --> 37:25.590
and make sure she can't work in this industry again.

684
37:25.590 --> 37:26.690
How about this?

685
37:27.190 --> 37:29.440
We don't want this turning into an even bigger scandal.

686
37:29.440 --> 37:32.240
Feifei, we're putting you on unpaid leave for now.

687
37:32.670 --> 37:33.790
How can an intern

688
37:34.000 --> 37:35.340
be put on unpaid leave?

689
37:35.340 --> 37:36.140
What the hell?

690
37:37.130 --> 37:37.780
The company

691
37:37.780 --> 37:39.490
has to consider the fallout, too.

692
37:39.490 --> 37:40.640
This unpaid leave

693
37:40.670 --> 37:41.880
is only temporary.

694
37:41.940 --> 37:43.470
We'll decide what to do next

695
37:43.670 --> 37:45.240
once the investigation is complete.

696
37:45.240 --> 37:47.900
This is the fairest way to handle things for now.

697
37:48.380 --> 37:49.940
Everything I said is true.

698
37:50.570 --> 37:51.940
That's just how she is.

699
37:52.400 --> 37:53.630
I didn't lie.

700
37:54.380 --> 37:56.000
Now you're playing the victim?

701
37:56.000 --> 37:56.730
I don't care.

702
37:56.730 --> 37:58.530
You'd better explain yourself.

703
37:58.540 --> 37:59.770
Otherwise, I'll make sure you trend online!

704
37:59.770 --> 38:01.370
I'll post your video online!

705
38:04.250 --> 38:06.250
Given the circumstances,

706
38:06.590 --> 38:08.300
the facts are pretty clear at this point.

707
38:08.300 --> 38:10.230
To prevent this from escalating further

708
38:10.230 --> 38:12.280
and to give everyone an explanation,

709
38:12.280 --> 38:13.070
Du Gefei,

710
38:13.500 --> 38:14.530
you need to record

711
38:14.530 --> 38:15.900
a sincere apology video

712
38:15.900 --> 38:16.900
and post it online

713
38:17.030 --> 38:18.490
to explain what happened.

714
38:18.670 --> 38:19.380
This is

715
38:19.380 --> 38:21.030
the most effective

716
38:21.500 --> 38:23.700
and sensible way for you to handle this.

717
38:25.980 --> 38:27.110
Let's do it this way.

718
38:33.900 --> 38:34.440
I... I...

719
38:34.440 --> 38:35.970
You can drop me off up ahead.

720
38:38.690 --> 38:39.500
Li.

721
38:39.690 --> 38:42.290
What time does Yun Ye usually get out of school?

722
38:43.260 --> 38:45.520
He usually gets home around six or seven,

723
38:45.530 --> 38:47.060
unless something comes up.

724
38:48.750 --> 38:49.550
I'll be going.

725
38:51.570 --> 38:52.320
Thank you.

726
38:55.110 --> 38:55.800
See you next time, Yunyi.

727
38:55.800 --> 38:56.930
Thanks for the gift.

728
38:58.110 --> 38:58.730
Sorry.

729
38:58.780 --> 39:00.310
What was that you just said?

730
39:11.350 --> 39:15.010
♪ Dust upon time ♪

731
39:15.840 --> 39:18.400
♪ Every step soft and slow ♪

732
39:20.210 --> 39:23.390
♪ The room holds my profile ♪

733
39:24.320 --> 39:27.710
♪ Passing no verdict for anyone ♪

734
39:28.170 --> 39:29.090
Why are you here?

735
39:28.640 --> 39:32.660
♪ Wind brushes the half-drawn curtain ♪

736
39:31.230 --> 39:32.380
I tried calling you.

737
39:33.060 --> 39:36.710
♪ Carrying away unneeded words ♪

738
39:34.480 --> 39:35.630
My phone was in my bag.

739
39:35.630 --> 39:37.090
I probably didn't hear it.

740
39:37.130 --> 39:41.200
♪ Is it true that the more we wish for what we want ♪

741
39:38.230 --> 39:39.900
Have you been waiting for me?

742
39:41.220 --> 39:45.460
♪ The more we tend to fall short? ♪

743
39:43.550 --> 39:44.190
Well...

744
39:44.960 --> 39:46.090
The scarf...

745
39:45.760 --> 39:49.960
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

746
39:50.140 --> 39:53.710
♪ Afraid you'll see right through me ♪

747
39:54.090 --> 39:54.550
Here you go.

748
39:54.320 --> 39:58.210
♪ Does the fading light ♪

749
39:58.240 --> 40:02.290
♪ Decide it won't be whole? ♪

750
39:58.380 --> 39:59.460
You can keep it on.

751
39:59.460 --> 40:00.460
I'm okay, thanks.

752
40:02.690 --> 40:03.590
Thanks for the scarf.

753
40:03.070 --> 40:07.110
♪ Half of my thoughts ♪

754
40:07.130 --> 40:10.890
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

755
40:11.570 --> 40:15.390
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

756
40:12.010 --> 40:12.460
Hey.

757
40:15.420 --> 40:19.830
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

758
40:16.840 --> 40:17.170
Okay.

759
40:17.170 --> 40:18.300
I'll be right there.

760
40:21.130 --> 40:26.220
♪ Half the tale remains ♪
